      "question": "---- scheduling an examination at Central Wellness Clinic, clients will be asked a few health-related questions.",
      "choices": [
        "Whereas",
        "When",
        "Although",
        "At"
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "topic": "连词",
      "keywords": "when scheduling conjunction",
      "answer_explain": "When scheduling... 是 When clients are scheduling... 的省略形式，逻辑主语与主句 clients 一致，表示预约时。whereas 表对比，although 表让步，语义不符；At 也不能直接构成这里的 At scheduling 结构。",
      "question_type": "语法题",
      "choice_translations": [
        "然而；鉴于（连词）",
        "当……时",
        "虽然；尽管",
        "在（地点或时刻）"
      ],
      "explanation_structured": {
        "answer": "B",
        "question_type": "语法题",
        "grammar_point": "时间状语从句的省略：when＋现在分词",
        "analysis": "When scheduling... 是 When clients are scheduling... 的省略形式，逻辑主语与主句 clients 一致，表示预约时。whereas 表对比，although 表让步，语义不符；At 也不能直接构成这里的 At scheduling 结构。"
